# Third-party release binaries fetched for publishing (mcp-publisher, etc).
# One of these was swept into a commit by `git add -A` and put 19.4 MB of
# unrelated binary into the history; ignoring them stops that repeating.
mcp-publisher.exe
mcp-publisher
